Subject: [PATCH 15/29] Vehicles (holtburger fork): ISO Sidelifter and Pallet
 Jack Logistics

Implements HBV1 v7 wire protocol (0x0910 VehiclePalletJackAction/State, since=7 sidelifter fields on VehicleTrailerState, DeployableOnlineFlags.Stowed 0x10), deterministic 30 Hz SidelifterKinematics (40ft self-loading sidelifter WCID 4000032, ISO 3874 interlocks, 4-corner <= 6 deg slope & drop OBB separation check, outrigger side lock, container transfer lock, under-frame pallet jack rack), walk-behind PalletJackDeployable (WCID 4000035, persistent leaky-bucket 3.2 m/s speed cap across grab/release, terrain+walkable support probing, ISO 3691-5 stow/fork/drop interlocks, destroy operator release), ContainerLogistics 1:1 pinwheel LIFO solver with PalletCargoState preservation (Ammo/Fuel/Energy/ReloadTimer) across deployables/RadarStation/containers, tractor throttle/handbrake/hitch/unhitch/unmount locks during sidelift or movement, @trailer sidelift / @palletjack admin commands, and Dericost bit-15 preservation in LScape/BuildingObj plus occupied-landblock unload guard.

Verified: sync-ace-fixtures.sh --check exits 0, dotnet test -c Debug --filter FullyQualifiedName~Vehicles passes 317/317, --filter FullyQualifiedName~Landblock passes 11/11, Release build succeeds with 0 errors, and live E2E passes (60/60 logistics, 92/92 semi-trailer).
